    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to rethink everything you know about chess! <strong>Chess Ultimate</strong> is a draft-based strategy game that combines the timeless appeal of chess with dynamic, game-changing twists. Build your dream team by drafting unique characters, each  with their own powerful abilities, and face off in battles where no two games are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/ff64257a67eb70f3be9036bc6b4b04c4.poster.avif?t=1752072238\" width=750 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/ff64257a67eb70f3be9036bc6b4b04c4.webm?t=1752072238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/ff64257a67eb70f3be9036bc6b4b04c4.mp4?t=1752072238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart your opponents with clever strategies, unleash your team, and dominate the board in this exciting reimagining of the classic game. Whether you're a chess enthusiast or a newcomer, <strong>Chess Ultimate</strong> offers fresh gameplay that keeps you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to draft, strategize, and conquer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/44f02ff0018f6f991c521aa40449585d.poster.avif?t=1752072238\" width=750 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/44f02ff0018f6f991c521aa40449585d.webm?t=1752072238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/44f02ff0018f6f991c521aa40449585d.mp4?t=1752072238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to rethink everything you know about chess! <strong>Chess Ultimate</strong> is a draft-based strategy game that combines the timeless appeal of chess with dynamic, game-changing twists. Build your dream team by drafting unique characters, each  with their own powerful abilities, and face off in battles where no two games are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/ff64257a67eb70f3be9036bc6b4b04c4.poster.avif?t=1752072238\" width=750 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/ff64257a67eb70f3be9036bc6b4b04c4.webm?t=1752072238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/ff64257a67eb70f3be9036bc6b4b04c4.mp4?t=1752072238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart your opponents with clever strategies, unleash your team, and dominate the board in this exciting reimagining of the classic game. Whether you're a chess enthusiast or a newcomer, <strong>Chess Ultimate</strong> offers fresh gameplay that keeps you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to draft, strategize, and conquer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/44f02ff0018f6f991c521aa40449585d.poster.avif?t=1752072238\" width=750 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/44f02ff0018f6f991c521aa40449585d.webm?t=1752072238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/44f02ff0018f6f991c521aa40449585d.mp4?t=1752072238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Chess just got an upgrade! Chess Ultimate, where precision strategy meets colorful chaos. Build your team from a roster of unique, quirky characters to defend your King while plotting your opponent\u2019s downfall. Easy to pick up, endlessly fun to master, and a fresh take on the classic game of wits.",
